00:23:57,532 --> 00:24:01,032
声が届くまで名前を呼んで
Calling out your name until my voice reaches you,

299
00:24:01,032 --> 00:24:05,032
出会えた奇跡感じたいもっと
I want to feel the miracle of our meeting even more.

300
00:24:05,032 --> 00:24:09,532
夢で高く跳んだ躯は
The body that leaped high in my dream

301
00:24:09,532 --> 00:24:13,032
どんな不安纏っても振り払っていく
shakes off any anxiety that clings to it.

302
00:24:13,032 --> 00:24:17,032
眠る小さな想い拡大して
Expanding the small sleeping feelings,

303
00:24:17,032 --> 00:24:20,032
気付く弱い私君がいれば
I realize if you are here, weak me

304
00:24:20,032 --> 00:24:24,032
暗い世界強くいれた
could be strong in a dark world.

305
00:24:24,032 --> 00:24:27,032
長い夢見る心はそう永遠で
My heart dreaming a long dream is forever true,

306
00:24:27,032 --> 00:24:31,032
暖かさに痛くて
even though it's always warm, it hurts so much.

307
00:24:31,032 --> 00:24:35,032
繋ぐ確かな願い重なり合って
Our certain, connecting wishes overlap.

308
00:24:35,032 --> 00:24:41,032
I want to always be with you

309
00:24:41,032 --> 00:24:47,032
I'll give you everything I have

310
00:24:47,032 --> 00:24:52,032
I want to hold you till the end

311
00:24:52,032 --> 00:24:59,032
I'll give you everything I have

312
00:25:10,915 --> 00:25:12,795
いろはちゃん！ハッピーニューイヤー！
Iroha-chan! Happy New Year!

313
00:25:14,655 --> 00:25:18,615
あれ？あれ、ちがくね？この子ちがくね？まちがえちゃった！
Huh? Wait, isn't this wrong? This girl is wrong! I made a mistake!

314
00:25:19,535 --> 00:25:24,495
いろは聞いて、今ね、ハッピーニューイヤーじゃなくて、メリークリスマスって
Listen, Iroha, right now, instead of Happy New Year, I was thinking of saying Merry Christmas...

315
00:25:24,495 --> 00:25:31,025
出てこようと思ってて、ハッピーバースデーじゃーんみたいな感じでやろうとしたんだけどさ
