00:35:50,106 --> 00:35:53,256
悲しみの海に沈んだ私
I've sunk deep into the sea of sadness,

425
00:35:53,256 --> 00:35:56,556
目を開けるのも億劫
where even opening my eyes is too much effort.

426
00:35:56,556 --> 00:36:00,556
このままどこまでをも堕ちて行き 誰にも見つけられないのかな
Will I keep falling endlessly like this, unable to be found by anyone?

427
00:36:03,956 --> 00:36:07,556
どこへ向かい 何をすれば?
Where should I head, what should I do?

428
00:36:07,556 --> 00:36:14,556
ふと射し込む一筋の光 手を伸ばせば届きそうだけど
A sudden ray of light shines through—if I reach out, it seems within reach,

429
00:36:14,556 --> 00:36:17,556
波にさらわれて見失った
but the waves carried it away and I lost it.

430
00:36:18,156 --> 00:36:21,556
あれは一体なんだったのかな
What in the world was that?

431
00:36:21,556 --> 00:36:25,056
温かくて眩しかったな
It was so warm and dazzling.

432
00:36:25,056 --> 00:36:28,556
無意識のカウンターイルミネーション 嘘つきは誰?
Unconscious counter-illumination, who is the liar?

433
00:36:28,856 --> 00:36:31,956
深海少女 まだまだ沈む
Deep sea girl, sinking further down,

434
00:36:31,956 --> 00:36:35,556
暗闇の彼方へ閉じこもる
shutting herself away in the distant darkness.

435
00:36:35,556 --> 00:36:42,556
深海少女 だけど知りたい 心惹かれるあの人を見つけたから
Deep sea girl, yet she wants to know, for she found someone who captivates her heart.

436
00:36:52,856 --> 00:36:56,056
昼も夜もなかったこの場所
This place had neither day nor night,

437
00:36:56,056 --> 00:37:00,256
なのに眠れない夜は続く
yet the sleepless nights go on.

438
00:37:00,256 --> 00:37:06,856
自由の羽大きく広げて 泳ぐあなたは綺麗でした
You looked so beautiful swimming with your freedom wings spread wide.

439
00:37:07,356 --> 00:37:13,856
そしてまた光は降り注ぐ 見とれていたらし目が合った
And then light pours down once more—as I gazed entranced, our eyes met.

440
00:37:13,856 --> 00:37:19,856
気付いてこっちを振り返るあなたに 嘘つきな私…
When you noticed and turned toward me, I lied to you...

441
00:37:20,556 --> 00:37:24,556
深海少女 わざわざ沈む 暗闇のさなかに赤い頬
Deep sea girl, purposely sinking down, red cheeks amidst the darkness.

442
00:37:24,556 --> 00:37:31,056
深海少女 ハダカの心を見せる勇気 黒い海がまだ許さない
Deep sea girl, still lacking the courage to bare her heart; the black ocean won't allow it yet.

443
00:37:31,056 --> 00:37:37,056
こんなに服は汚れてしまって 笑顔も醜くゆがんでいった
My clothes have grown so soiled, and my smile distorted so hatefully.

444
00:37:37,056 --> 00:37:41,556
誰にも合わせる顔なんてないの もう放っておいてよ!
I have no face to show anyone anymore—just leave me be!

445
00:37:41,556 --> 00:37:45,556
声にならない気持ちが溢れてとけた 次の瞬間、君が突然姿を消した
Unspoken feelings overflowed and dissolved; the next moment, you suddenly vanished.

446
00:37:45,556 --> 00:37:50,556
心配性の彼女は焦る 闇が彼を隠しひとりきり
Filled with anxiety, she panics as the shadows hide him away, leaving her all alone.

447
00:37:50,556 --> 00:37:54,056
限界少女 その手を伸ばす 「ほらね、君も素敵な色を隠してた」
Reaching her limit, she stretches out her hand: "See? You were hiding a wonderful color too."

448
00:38:00,056 --> 00:38:05,056
深海少女 腕を引かれる 歌う祝福のマリスノーツ
Deep sea girl, her arm is pulled—the blessing of Maris Stella sings out.

449
00:38:13,556 --> 00:38:20,056
次の瞬間 君が突然 姿を消した… 消した
In the blink of an eye, you suddenly vanished... vanished.

450
00:38:21,056 --> 00:38:30,056
心配性の彼女は焦る 闇が彼を隠し…
Filled with anxiety, she panics as the shadows hide him away...

451
00:38:30,056 --> 00:38:37,056
限界少女 その手を伸ばす ほらね 君も素敵な色を隠してたんだ
Reaching her limit, she stretches out her hand: "See? You were hiding a wonderful color too."

452
00:38:39,056 --> 00:38:47,056
深海少女 腕を引かれる 歌う祝福のマリンスノウ
Deep sea girl, her arm is pulled—the blessing of Marine Snow sings out.

453
00:38:47,056 --> 00:38:55,056
深海少女 もっと知りたい 心惹かれるあの人を見つけたから
Deep sea girl, she wants to know more, for she found the person who captivates her heart.

454
00:39:03,056 --> 00:39:18,056
この海を出て 今飛び立つのだ
Leaving this sea, now she will take flight!

455
00:39:28,556 --> 00:39:32,056
いろはちゃん、お誕生日おめでとう！
Iroha-chan, happy birthday!

456
00:39:33,056 --> 00:39:36,556
はすきー、ハッピーバースデー！ありがとう！
Hazuki— Happy Birthday! Thank you so much!

457
00:39:36,556 --> 00:39:38,056
どうも、AZKiです。
Hello, I'm AZKi.

458
00:39:38,056 --> 00:39:46,556
えー、いろはちゃんとは、今年もあずいろでグッズを一緒に買いに行ったり…
Uh, Iroha-chan and I went shopping for Azuiro goods together this year...

459
00:39:46,556 --> 00:39:53,056
個人的に、串カツ屋さんに行ったり…
And went to kushikatsu restaurants personally...

460
00:39:53,056 --> 00:39:59,056
いつも仲良くしてくれて、ありがとう！
Thank you for always being such a good friend!

461
00:40:00,184 --> 00:40:01,934
ライブの時に歌った桜ロックも
The Sakura Rock we sang at the live,

462
00:40:01,934 --> 00:40:05,244
二人、歌声が合っていたし？
did you two sound good together?

463
00:40:05,244 --> 00:40:05,964
っていたし？
Right?

464
00:40:05,964 --> 00:40:11,914
なんと、この後も一緒に歌っちゃう？歌っちゃうのか！
And what, we're gonna sing together again after this?

465
00:40:12,844 --> 00:40:18,124
ということで、これからもぜひあずいろよろしくお願いします！
So from here on too, please look forward to it, Iroha.

466
00:40:18,124 --> 00:40:19,524
これからもよろしくお願いします。
Please look forward to it.

467
00:40:20,044 --> 00:40:24,014
ということで、今からワープして、そちらに向かいます！
So, right now we'll warp and head to our destination!

468
00:40:24,144 --> 00:40:27,624
いってらっしゃーい！
See you there!

469
00:40:27,624 --> 00:40:28,114
可愛いな。
So cute.

470
00:40:45,462 --> 00:40:48,562
誰よりも近くにいた その声は聴こえなくて
Closer to me than anyone else, I couldn't hear that voice.

471
00:40:48,952 --> 00:40:51,712
刻み続けていた時の中で やっと君に逢えたから
Within the ticking time, I was finally able to meet you.

472
00:40:52,052 --> 00:40:55,842
sister's noise 探し続ける 彷徨う心の場所を
sister's noise, continuing to search for a wandering heart's place.

473
00:40:56,062 --> 00:40:59,342
重ね合った この想いは誰にも壊せないから...！
These overlapping feelings cannot be destroyed by anyone...

474
00:41:15,592 --> 00:41:17,452
街は密やかに 君を隠していた
The streets were quietly hiding you away.

475
00:41:17,452 --> 00:41:21,152
辿り着いた場所を 蘇るあの記憶
The place I arrived at revives those memories.

476
00:41:21,152 --> 00:41:24,252
繰り返されていた 真実は遠く
It was repeating, the truth is far away.

477
00:41:24,252 --> 00:41:26,612
君のその痛み 気づけないまま
Without even realizing your pain.

478
00:41:26,612 --> 00:41:29,692
あの日誓ったその夢が 私を切り裂いても
Even if the dream I wished upon that day tears me apart,

479
00:41:29,692 --> 00:41:33,342
何よりも大切な 希望だけ信じ貫いて
I will keep believing in the hope that is more precious than anything.

480
00:41:33,342 --> 00:41:37,382
自分らしく生きること 何よりも伝えたくて
I want to convey living true to myself more than anything,

481
00:41:37,382 --> 00:42:10,662
生まれ続く哀しみの痛み その意味を刻むなら
if I'm to carve out the meaning of the sorrowful pain that keeps being born.

482
00:42:10,662 --> 00:42:14,352
sister's noise いま届けるよ 涙さえ能力(チカラ)にして
sister's noise, deliver it now, turning even tears into power.

483
00:42:14,352 --> 00:42:17,652
繋がり合う 強さだけが全てを打ち抜いていく
Connected strengths are what cut through everything.

484
00:41:41,432 --> 00:41:45,452
夕暮れの放課後 いつもの街並み
After-school in the dusk, the usual streetscape.

485
00:41:45,452 --> 00:41:48,952
ふと見上げた空想い出す 優しさを
I remember the sky I casually looked up at, and its kindness.

486
00:41:48,952 --> 00:41:52,552
君の眼差しが 気づかせてくれた
Your gaze made me realize

487
00:41:52,552 --> 00:41:56,622
弱さ認める 勇気の強さを
the strength in the courage to admit my weakness.

488
00:41:56,622 --> 00:42:00,392
温かな君のその手が 私を導いていく
Your warm hand guides me on.

489
00:42:00,392 --> 00:42:04,212
何よりも守りたい 希望が闇を貫くから
Because the hope I want to protect more than anything pierces through the darkness.

490
00:42:04,212 --> 00:42:07,792
抱きしめた熱い想い この世界を照らすから
The warm feelings I held close will illuminate this world.

491
00:42:07,792 --> 00:42:11,902
走り続け探し続けていた 君の夢が動き出す
Continuing to run and search, your dream starts to move.

492
00:42:11,902 --> 00:42:15,582
sister's noise 響きはじめる 高らかな生命の意味
sister's noise, the sound begins to echo, the grand meaning of life.

493
00:42:15,582 --> 00:42:19,532
理解ってるよ かけがえない絆は壊せないこと
I understand, irreplaceable bonds cannot be broken.

494
